{'symbol': 'PAYX', 'date': '2023-04-28 08:49:00', 'title': 'PAYCHEX DECLARES A 13% INCREASE IN QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': "ROCHESTER, N.Y.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--PAYCHEX, INC. (NASDAQ: PAYX), A LEADING PROVIDER OF INTEGRATED HUMAN CAPITAL MANAGEMENT SOFTWARE SOLUTIONS FOR HUMAN RESOURCES, PAYROLL, BENEFITS, AND INSURANCE SERVICES, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS APPROVED A $.10 INCREASE IN THE COMPANY'S REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND, AN INCREASE OF 13 PERCENT. THE DIVIDEND WILL INCREASE FROM $.79 PER SHARE TO $.89 PER SHARE AND IS PAYABLE MAY 25, 2023 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD MAY 11, 2023. “OUR BOARD'S DECISIO."}